<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Grace has come as Christ Himself, my life and everything to be;</l><l>No more I, but Christ the Lord as grace is reigning now in me,</l><l>Grace divine infused, transmitted, Satisfies continually!</l><l>Life with Him is rich, indeed!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All-sufficient Burden-bearer, grace through weakness is increased;</l><l>Pow’r of Christ, through suff’rings, trials, tabernacles over me.</l><l>Multiplying grace, o’erflowing, from the throne of grace proceeds,</l><l>Timely grace for all my needs!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
